p.src:
Promoting the classical variables in Equation  to operators gives $\hat H
  =
  \frac12\hat p^{\,2}
  +
  \frac12\omega^2\hat x^{\,2}.$ Its action on a wave function is $(\hat H\psi)(x)
  =
  -\frac{\hbar^2}{2}
  \frac{\partial^2\psi}{\partial x^2}
  +
  \frac12\omega^2x^2\psi(x).$

