  &=
  (\hat p+i\omega\hat x)
  (\hat p-i\omega\hat x)\\
  &=
  \hat p^{\,2}+\omega^2\hat x^{\,2}
  +i\omega[\hat x,\hat p]\\
  &=
  \hat p^{\,2}+\omega^2\hat x^{\,2}
  -\hbar\omega.
  \end{aligned}

p.src:
The complete spectrum is $\boxed{
  E_n=\hbar\omega\left(n+\frac12\right),
  \qquad n=0,1,2,\ldots .}$ Successive levels are separated by the fixed quantum $\hbar\omega$: $E_{n+1}-E_n=\hbar\omega.$

